tag-rust implements tabletop game simulation in Rust with Python integration.
Public Java TabletopGames (MIT licensed) is a behavioral reference for adapted
game/framework/search semantics. Its MIT permission and disclaimer are retained
in LICENSE-MIT. Full per-component origins are recorded in docs/source-notices.md
in the source distribution/repository. No third-party game artwork is embedded
in this wheel. Rust dependency licence texts are preserved separately in
RUST-DEPENDENCY-NOTICES.txt; their terms remain applicable.
